{"id": "t173-001", "text": "Femi starts at the new agency on Monday. He sounded a bit nervous about the commute but excited overall. Remind me to text him Monday evening to see how the first day went. He's been at the old place for nearly six years, so it's a big change. His wife Joy is doing the school runs for the first week so he can get in early and make a good impression.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new agency", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "nearly six years"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first week", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t173-002", "text": "Kiara and her husband are viewing two flats in Leeds this weekend. They want somewhere with a garden for the dog, Biscuit.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing two flats in Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog, Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t173-003", "text": "Mohammed is retiring at the end of the month after thirty-one years at the council. There's a lunch for him sometime next week, date TBC.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after thirty-one years"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t173-004", "text": "Call with Kasia. Her daughter Zofia sits her A-level exams in early June and Kasia is more stressed than Zofia is. Zofia wants to study architecture at Sheffield, and her offer depends on getting an A in maths. Kasia says she's revising every evening and hardly leaves her room.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "A-level exams", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to study architecture at Sheffield", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "offer depends on getting an A in maths", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening"}]}
{"id": "t173-005", "text": "Need to book the van for the move. Ideally Saturday morning, otherwise the following weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book the van for the move", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the following weekend", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t173-006", "text": "Esther got the promotion! She's now head of operations. Don't forget to send her flowers before Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "head of operations", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t173-007", "text": "Alessia's son starts primary school next Tuesday. She's dreading the drop-off more than he is.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alessia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "primary school", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the drop-off", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t173-008", "text": "Juan mentioned he's thinking of leaving his job over the summer to go back to uni. Nothing decided yet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Juan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving his job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "go back to uni", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t173-009", "text": "Giulia's leaving drinks are off, apparently her manager convinced her to stay another six months. I should ask her how she feels about it when things calm down.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stay", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "another six months", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her how she feels about it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when things calm down", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t173-010", "text": "Divya is moving to Glasgow in a fortnight for the new role. She's never lived outside London. Remind me to ask Divya for her new address so I can post something. She's renting a two-bed in the West End with a colleague to start with. Her parents are driving up with her stuff the weekend before she starts, and she's having a small goodbye dinner on Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new role", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Divya for her new address", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "renting a two-bed in the West End with a colleague", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before she starts", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "small goodbye dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t173-011", "text": "Kaito Nakamura passed his driving test this morning on the third attempt. Very relieved.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kaito Nakamura", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t173-012", "text": "Omar's little girl graduated from nursery today. He sent a photo of her in a tiny cap and gown.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little girl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduated from nursery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t173-013", "text": "Bumped into Kenji at the station. He's just started at a law firm in Canary Wharf and works ridiculous hours. Looks shattered.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kenji", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "law firm", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works ridiculous hours", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "shattered", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t173-014", "text": "Elijah's interview at the hospital is Thursday afternoon. He's really anxious about the panel part. Text him good luck Wednesday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the hospital", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t173-015", "text": "Ines and Adebayo finally got the keys to their new place! Housewarming is sometime early next month, they'll confirm.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adebayo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the keys to their new place", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime early next month", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t173-016", "text": "Mia loves rock climbing and has just started bouldering twice a week. Might be a good birthday idea, she mentioned wanting new chalk bags.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "rock climbing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "twice a week"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting new chalk bags", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t173-017", "text": "Spoke to Mei about her first week as a teacher. It went better than she expected, though the Year 9s are tough. Her mum is visiting from Shanghai in late November. She asked if I knew any good dim sum places near her flat for when her mum arrives. I said I'd think about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first week as a teacher", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting from Shanghai", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in late November", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t173-018", "text": "Amir's dad had his retirement party on Saturday. I couldn't make it, so I must call Amir tomorrow to hear how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amir", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retirement party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call Amir", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amir", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t173-019", "text": "Dong is a huge Arsenal fan and goes to most home games with his brother Rory.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Arsenal", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rory", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t173-020", "text": "Joy said the flat viewing on Elm Road was a disaster: damp everywhere and the landlord didn't turn up. She has another one Friday at noon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flat viewing on Elm Road", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "another one", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at noon", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t173-021", "text": "Obi just got into Edinburgh for medicine! His parents are over the moon. Send him a card and maybe a voucher.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Obi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into Edinburgh for medicine", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send him a card and maybe a voucher", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t173-022", "text": "Bruno is relocating to Lisbon with work at the start of March. His wife Camila is staying here until the kids finish the school year. Bruno's flying out on the Sunday and coming back every other weekend. Camila is a bit anxious about doing the school runs and her own job on her own for a few months, and their youngest, Leo, has his first nativity play in December.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "relocating to Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the start of March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every other weekend"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit anxious", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few months"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "youngest", "owner": "p5", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leo", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first nativity play", "owner": "p5", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "in December", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t173-023", "text": "Ryan's sister Bethany has her graduation ceremony on the 14th, and the whole family is driving up to Durham for it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduation ceremony", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}]}
