{"id": "t173-029", "text": "Coffee with Femi. His boss is leaving at Christmas and Femi might be asked to step up. He'd be great at it but isn't sure he wants the stress.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "step up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't sure he wants the stress", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
