{"id": "t173-031", "text": "Mohammed Ibrahim mentioned his wife is a keen gardener and has been after a new pair of secateurs. Good gift idea for her birthday in May.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed Ibrahim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "gardener", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "after a new pair of secateurs", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t173-032", "text": "Long chat with Kasia tonight. She's finally decided to sell the house in Croydon and move closer to her parents in Krak\u00f3w, probably over the summer once the sale goes through. She's nervous about the kids changing schools, especially Tomek, who's just settled into his football team. Her brother Piotr is helping with the paperwork. I need to send her that estate agent's number before the weekend and ask her when the leaving do is.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "sell the house in Croydon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "once the sale goes through", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "changing schools", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomek", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "football", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Piotr", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that estate agent's number", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her when the leaving do is", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t173-033", "text": "Esther's son Caleb got his GCSE results back, all sevens and above. She's so proud.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caleb", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "GCSE results", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t173-034", "text": "Alessia has been offered a promotion but it would mean moving to Manchester. She has until next Friday to decide.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alessia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Manchester", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until next Friday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t173-035", "text": "Remind me to ask Juan how his partner's surgery went on Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Juan how his partner's surgery went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Juan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t173-036", "text": "Giulia's mum is retiring from nursing at the end of the year. They're planning a surprise party but haven't picked a date.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring from nursing", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t173-037", "text": "Divya, or Div as everyone at work calls her, just bought her first flat. It's a one-bed in Hackney, completion sometime in early December.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Div", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first flat", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "one-bed in Hackney", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "completion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in early December", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t173-038", "text": "I'm helping Kaito move on Sunday. Need to bring the trolley and some extra boxes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kaito", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring the trolley and some extra boxes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}]}
{"id": "t173-039", "text": "Omar had his final day at the bank yesterday after twelve years. Leaving drinks went late. He starts the new role with the startup in a fortnight. He's moving across from retail banking into product, which he's wanted for ages. He asked me to keep the twenty-second free for a proper celebration dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "final day at the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after twelve years"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new role with the startup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "ages"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the twenty-second", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "celebration dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t173-040", "text": "Kenji's daughter Hana took her first steps this weekend. He's absolutely besotted.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kenji", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first steps", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "absolutely besotted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t173-041", "text": "Elijah didn't get the job. He took it well on the phone, but I could tell he was gutted. I should call him over the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "didn't get the job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t173-042", "text": "Ines is a vegetarian and doesn't drink, so keep that in mind for the dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t173-043", "text": "Adebayo Okafor has his PhD viva on Tuesday. He's been preparing for months and says he can't sleep. Must message him the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adebayo Okafor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD viva", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "months"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t173-044", "text": "Mia's brother Luca is graduating from Bristol in July. She's flying back from Spain for it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduating from Bristol", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in July", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back from Spain", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t173-045", "text": "Mei and her girlfriend are moving in together at the end of the month. They're looking at places in Walthamstow.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving in together", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t173-046", "text": "Amir got a dog! A rescue greyhound called Toffee. He's taking a week off work to settle her in. Toffee is very timid, scared of the hoover and other dogs, so he's walking her really early in the morning. His girlfriend Kiara thinks she'll come out of her shell in a month or so.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got a dog", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rescue greyhound called Toffee", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "really early in the morning"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a month or so"}]}
{"id": "t173-047", "text": "Quick call with Dong. He said his mum is having her knee replaced sometime next week and he'll be staying with her for a bit afterwards. Remind me to check how she's getting on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having her knee replaced", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a bit afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check how she's getting on", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t173-048", "text": "Joy has a new job at the BBC. She starts the first week of January and is thrilled.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the BBC", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first week of January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t173-049", "text": "Obi's mum is moving into sheltered housing on Thursday. He's taking the day off to help. It's been a hard few months for the family.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Obi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving into sheltered housing", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hard few months", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t173-050", "text": "Bruno Schmidt hates surprises and big parties, so a small dinner is better for his fortieth.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno Schmidt", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates surprises and big parties", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fortieth", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}]}
{"id": "t173-051", "text": "Ryan has just been made a partner at the firm. Champagne's on him, he says, sometime next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made a partner at the firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Champagne", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t173-052", "text": "Rory's moving to Berlin in early April for a two-year contract. He's learning German on Duolingo every morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rory", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Berlin", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "two-year contract", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "learning German", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every morning"}]}
{"id": "t173-053", "text": "Chioma's son Ikenna sits his eleven-plus on Saturday. Chioma says he's calm but she's a wreck. She's been doing practice papers every evening with him since September, and she's taking him for pancakes afterwards whatever happens. Remind me to text Chioma Saturday afternoon to ask how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ikenna", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "eleven-plus", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "calm", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "a wreck", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "since September"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Chioma", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t173-054", "text": "Camila mentioned she's been training for the Brighton half marathon in April. Ask her about it next time.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Brighton half marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her about it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next time", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t173-055", "text": "Manon's flat viewing got cancelled because the landlord sold the place. She's back to square one.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Manon", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t173-056", "text": "Emre's dad passed away on Sunday. The funeral is next Thursday at eleven. I need to send a card and ask if they need anything.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emre", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday at eleven", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask if they need anything", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t173-057", "text": "Remember to cancel the gym membership before the end of the month and sort out the electricity meter reading tomorrow.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "cancel the gym membership", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the end of the month", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort out the electricity meter reading", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t173-058", "text": "Tobi's oldest, Grace, has her first university open day on Friday and her second the following weekend. He's driving her to both.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tobi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "oldest", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Grace", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first university open day", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the following weekend", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t173-059", "text": "Bethany Morris finished her probation at the hospital. Permanent contract from next month. Brilliant news.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany Morris", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "probation at the hospital", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Permanent contract", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from next month", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t173-060", "text": "Dinner with Esther and her partner Ade on Saturday. Esther told me her brother Sam is finally moving back from Toronto in late January, and their parents are throwing a welcome home party for him the weekend after he lands. She also mentioned her niece starts nursery in the new year. Don't forget to ask Esther what Sam's into, so I can bring a small present to the party.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ade", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back from Toronto", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in late January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "welcome home party", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after he lands", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "niece", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Esther what Sam's into", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}]}
